-- CK-312: (#1225) a list pattern over a 1 000-item literal of fresh lists
-- checks (ownership-v2.md §4.1, #1224). The pattern's rebuild is growth
-- since #1224, but `Demands.resolve` inspects the push's 1 000 alternatives
-- on the demand's own lane before it enters the product task, so v2 gives
-- `ownership_accounting_invariant (direct_demand_query lane)` instead of
-- v1's verdict.

